    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2074" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθυρ-μα</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθύρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plaything, toy</i>, <i><span class="en">
