				Od.
				18.323
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				20a
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; <i>delight, joy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπολλώνιον
